# Image viewer (0.0.5j): Print Screen writes /tmp/screenshot-1.bmp; Files,
# opened at / then into tmp, shows it in the viewer on a double-click;
# "Set as wallpaper" makes it the background. 1280x800. The Files window
# opens at 200,152 (640x440), rows from y=229, 26 apart; the viewer's
# wallpaper button is at the top right of its content.
gui: desktop up at 1280x800
cerberus kernel shell
!keys print
!wait 1.5
!mouseto 150 780
!button left down
!button left up
!wait 0.4
!key files
!wait 1
!mouseto 260 397
!dblclick
!wait 0.6
!mouseto 260 241
!dblclick
!wait 1.5
!screenshot build/viewer-1.png
# The viewer frame is at 250,162 (720x520; content from 251,195): the
# button spans the last 140 px of the content's width, 5..31 down.
!mouseto 900 213
!button left down
!button left up
!wait 1.5
!screenshot build/viewer-2.png
!keys alt f4
!wait 0.3
!keys alt f4
!wait 0.3
!mouseto 120 400
!button left down
!button left up
!key ticks
!wait 0.5
ticks=
